{"scene_id": "s02209", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s02209.fountain", "heading": "EXT. DRY-DOCK SHIPYARD - ROWING TANK - DAWN", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "NAOMI BERENSON", "names": ["NAOMI BERENSON", "NAOMI"], "gender": "f", "first": 5, "spoke": 13}, {"id": 1, "name": "COACH ILSE VORHEES", "names": ["COACH ILSE VORHEES", "COACH VORHEES"], "gender": "f", "first": 24, "spoke": 16}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "EXT. DRY-DOCK SHIPYARD - ROWING TANK - DAWN", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A vast concrete basin, drained and refilled with grey-green water, used by the old shipyard for hull testing and now, secretly, as a rowing course.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Rusted cranes loom like skeletal herons.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Mist lies on the surface.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "A racing shell sits at the dock, a single scull, polished cedar.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Beside it stands NAOMI BERENSON (30s, Olympic hopeful, lean, hair cropped) in a rain jacket, hands on hips, studying the water.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Her breath fogs.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Her calf muscles twitch.", "para": 1, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "She is alone, and she has been alone for a long time.", "para": 1, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "She crouches, tests the water with two fingers, wipes them on her thigh.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "She sets the scull in the water and lowers herself into it with one fluid movement.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "The oars dip.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "She begins to row.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "The scull glides across the basin.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Her stroke is long and exact.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "The mist parts, closes behind her.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "A gull cries.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Somewhere beyond the cranes a siren is heard and fades.", "para": 4, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "She reaches the far end, turns the shell with two pulls, and comes back.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Faster now.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "The oars bite deeper.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Her shoulders flare, her breath hitches, and the water boils behind the blades.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "At the dock, a figure has appeared.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "A woman in a heavy wool coat, thermos in hand, standing absolutely still.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "This is COACH ILSE VORHEES (60s, grey crop, stern as a gravestone).", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "She watches the scull approach.", "para": 6, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Naomi sees her.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Her stroke falters.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "The right oar catches the water at a bad angle and the boat veers.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "She corrects it.", "para": 7, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Her breath is ragged.", "para": 7, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Don't stop.", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["calling"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm not stopping.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["between breaths"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then why are you slowing?", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm not.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Look at the clock.", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Naomi glances at the waterproof watch strapped to the bow.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Her face falls.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Six minutes fifty.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Not good enough.", "para": 8, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm having an off day.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You've been having an off day for a year.", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "The scull glides the last twenty metres.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Naomi ships the oars, lets the boat drift to the dock, and sits there gasping.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Vorhees crouches, extends a hand.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Naomi takes it and is hauled out onto the concrete.", "para": 9, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "She sits against a bollard, chest heaving.", "para": 9, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Why are you here?", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "To tell you that Beijing is eleven weeks away.", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know when Beijing is.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Do you? Because you row like someone who has forgotten.", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Naomi stares at the water.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "The scull rocks gently at its mooring.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Vorhees unscrews the thermos and pours tea into the cap.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "She hands it over.", "para": 10, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Drink.", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Naomi drinks.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "The steam rises between them.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I think I'm done.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You think.", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then say it properly.", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Naomi looks at her.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Looks away.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "The cranes, the mist, the grey water.", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I can't do it anymore.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "The thermos cap trembles in her hands.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Vorhees does not speak for a long time.", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Then she sits down on the concrete beside her, heavily, like a woman putting down a load she has carried too long.", "para": 13, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Do you know why I came this morning?", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "To tell me I'm slow.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "To tell you that I stopped timing you in March.", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Naomi turns, slowly.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Every split since March was a lie. I wrote down numbers I knew you'd hit. You've been faster than you think for months.", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's not funny.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm not laughing.", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Why?", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 78, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Because you needed someone to lie to you.", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "The sun breaks over the cranes.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Light floods the basin.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "The mist burns off in a single rolling wave, and the water flashes gold.", "para": 15, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Naomi starts to laugh.", "para": 15, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "It turns into something between laughing and weeping.", "para": 15, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Vorhees puts an arm around her.", "para": 15, "sent": 5, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Neither of them looks at the other.", "para": 15, "sent": 6, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 86, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're awful.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 87, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm your coach.", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Naomi wipes her face with her sleeve.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "She looks at the scull, already steaming in the sun.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 90, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Again?", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 91, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Again.", "name": "COACH VORHEES", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}]}